<title>UK: Bremer Landesbank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</title>
<headline>Bremer Landesbank sets 1.0 bln Czech crown bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Investmentbank Austria and WoodCommerz.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BREMER LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BREMER LANDESBANK KREDITANSTALT OLDENBURG GZ</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN CZK   COUPON     10.375    MATURITY    15.APR.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.95    PAY DATE    15.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.25	REOFFER    99.95     SPREAD	=</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 25	SALE LIMITS US/GB/DE/CZ</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.25	SELL CONC  1.00	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
